# Frontend Configuration
#
# No VITE_API_URL: the frontend calls the API via same-origin relative paths
# (/api/...) both in production (frontend + API on the same Vercel deployment) and in
# local dev (Vite's dev server proxies /api to the backend - see vite.config.js).
#
# No VITE_LIVEKIT_URL either: the LiveKit server URL comes from the backend's
# /api/livekit/token response (LIVEKIT_URL there), not a build-time frontend env var.
#
# Anything genuinely needed here in the future must be prefixed VITE_ to be exposed to
# the browser bundle - never put a secret (API keys, JWT secret, etc.) behind that
# prefix, since it ships in the client-side JS.
